# ── MARK LVI — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
config/api_keys.json
config/certs/
config/whatsapp_web/

**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# Local session metadata
memory/session_*.json

# Recovery copies of personal memory
memory/*.backup.json
memory/.memory-*
memory/*.db-journal
memory/*.db-wal
memory/*.db-shm

# User screen recordings
recordings/

# Local speech model and screen troubleshooting evidence
models/
memory/screen_cases/

# Earth library installation state; bundled vendor files are runtime assets
web/earth/node_modules/
memory/earth_cache/

# Mission evidence, calendar snapshots and integration credentials
memory/missions/
config/home-assistant-private.json
config/briefing-calendar.ics
config/briefing-settings.json
config/place-services.json
config/voice-interaction.json

# Private isolated project copies, edit proposals and rollback baselines
memory/sandboxes/

# Private learning journal, market/security caches and automatic-refresh state
memory/intelligence/
memory/auto-learning-state.json
config/auto-learning.json
memory/knowledge-brief.json

# Personal encrypted vaults, restore staging/rollback and scenario reports
*.jarvismem
memory/restore-pending.json
memory/restore-state.json
memory/restore-rollback/
memory/scenarios/
memory/restore-work/

# Persistent provider quota cooldowns
memory/provider-cooldowns.json

# Personal runtime data written by the news and trading tools
memory/news-interests.json
memory/trading-playbook-user.json

# Owner signatures, wellbeing baseline, phone link secrets and agent jobs (personal data)
config/phone-link.json
config/wellbeing.json
config/owner-guard.json
memory/owner/
memory/agents/
memory/voice-baseline.json
memory/last-diagnostic.md
